{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18908","headline":"送王师鲁协律赴湖南使幕 · 刘禹锡","name":"送王师鲁协律赴湖南使幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩马上郎，驱传渡三湘。\n橘树沙洲暗，松醪酒肆香。\n素风传竹帛，高价聘琳琅。\n楚水多兰芷，何人事搴芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}